# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CARA-Traffic-Control — public repository policy
#
# The manuscript is under review. To avoid the method, experimental design,
# numerical results, and supplementary material being borrowed before
# publication, the PUBLIC repository tracks CODE ONLY.
#
# Withheld from the public repo (provided to reviewers through the journal's
# confidential channel instead):
#   supplement/        supplementary material (S1–S7, tables, cover letter)
#   outputs/           paper figures and paper tables
#   results/           detector models, RL checkpoints, tensorboard logs
#   data/              pre-computed evidence CSVs, scalers, feature metadata
#   new_experiments/   per-experiment result CSVs
#   checkpoints/       model checkpoints
#   *.zip              frozen release packages
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Withheld paper content (NOT tracked) ─────────────────────────────
supplement/
outputs/
results/
data/
new_experiments/
checkpoints/
*.zip

# Reviewer-facing reproduction drivers (read the withheld result data and
# encode the paper's table structure; shipped with the confidential artifact)
scripts/reproduce_result_tables.py
scripts/reproduce_feature_ablation.py
scripts/reproduce_nonoverlap_robustness.py
scripts/reproduce_chronological_symmetric.py
scripts/reproduce_oracle_label_distribution.py
scripts/reproduce_no_rho_ablation.py
scripts/reproduce_ovs_summary.py

# Internal notes / paper result registries (NOT tracked)
MIGRATION_GUIDE.md
REPRODUCIBILITY.md
results_registry.csv
table_mapping.md

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

# Virtual environments
venv/
env/
ENV/

